{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/field_flower_02.gif?t=1742200105\" /><strong>Garden of Witches</strong> is a roguelike filled with elaborate action while still managing to be cozy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As long as you never give up, the garden will be saved! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She's waiting for you...... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The witches need to throw a tea party!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/boss_awake.gif?t=1742200105\" />The garden is on the brink of collapse,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">all because these lazy, irresponsible witches don't keep their promises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While it's tempting to let the garden perish to teach them a lesson, the protagonist, Sil, refuses to let that happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's time to get a move on and save the garden, or else all that work building her perfect home will go to waste! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The garden is a dangerous place.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/battle_01.gif?t=1742200105\" />Use the abilities you gain by progressing through the stages to defeat monsters and &quot;persuade&quot; the unruly witches to join the tea party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry if you get knocked down along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story will not change, and you will have the chance to try again with more powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can always go back home to Improve your abilities and revise your strategy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controller Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Garden of Witches supports most controllers, including Xbox and PlayStation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also play mouse-free using only the keyboard. (Arrow keys, Z, X, C, A, D, Space, Tab, Esc) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Please support Garden of Witches by clicking &quot;Add to your wishlist&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/cat_600x400.gif?t=1742200105\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2530470?t=1742200105","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742200105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/d666e0140803165395695edad88ed09db3f65946/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742200105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/d666e0140803165395695edad88ed09db3f65946/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742200105","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3187780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/field_flower_02.gif?t=1742200105\" /><strong>Garden of Witches</strong> is a roguelike filled with elaborate action while still managing to be cozy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As long as you never give up, the garden will be saved! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She's waiting for you...... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The witches need to throw a tea party!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530470/extras/boss_awake.gif?t=1742200105\" />The garden is on the brink of collapse,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">all because these lazy, irr